# generate_presets.py -> Resources/Public/**/*.repatch
# Renderer inputs (incl. exact font hashes) pinned in Docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md
Examples/YouKnow/GUI2D/*.png
Examples/YouKnow/Resources/Public/

# GUI/Output is re-included only for the authored HD GUI definition
!Examples/YouKnow/GUI/Output/
Examples/YouKnow/GUI/Output/*
!Examples/YouKnow/GUI/Output/gui.lua
